{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah. Praise God in His sanctuary, praise Him in His strong firmament. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him for His mighty deeds, praise Him according to the abundance of His greatness. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him with the Shofar’s blast, praise Him with zither and harp, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him with timbrel and dance, "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n86.jpg","n":"28"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"praise Him on string instruments and flute. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him with the clash of cymbals, praise Him with the ring of cymbals. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/150/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let all with breath praise the Lord, Halleluyah. "}
